{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_07_end","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_07","title":"梦四时","storyCode":"HS-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"c82b423aba98ef5cc2f1b8616b54b93b74303a810eab65abb24e3070006117e1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"为了保护自己的土地，大荒城众人展示出了无可动摇的团结与勇气。\n或许是因为与这片土地深厚的联系，一缕模糊的意识在混沌中重新凝聚。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哑巴大叔？你在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别去打那些怪物，快出来！和我一起走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诡异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（凄厉的长鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他沉浸在自己的战场里。\n他所对战的敌人不可说，他的舌头僵死在口中。\n他所爱的人已经离去，看不到下一次春天的到来。\n他高高举起自己的武器，他只知道自己好像要保护什么。\n保护......什么？\n一阵笛声悠悠地传来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（努力地吹着笛子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔！大叔！我在这里！快过来，别在树林里待着了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我一起走吧！我们回家去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诡异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖啸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为我怕你！丑东西，滚开——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一柄长斧钉在诡异怪物的正胸口，怪物奋力地鼓起身躯，最终丝线脱力地四散，铺在地上。\n长斧脱手后，樵夫的手还维持着掷出武器的动作，双眼看不清，他低头侧耳，细细分辨着四周的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔！终于找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里！你快过来！我带你去安全的地方！"},{"type":"narration","text":"樵夫侧耳听了听，向小满的方向望去。\n随即他再度提起斧子，转身准备走向树林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔？大叔！前面很危险，你不能回去了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满横起笛子，努力平了平气息，吹起了曲子。\n花开了，快回家吧♪\n你听，你听，是我在呼唤你回来♪\n樵夫并没有停下脚步。几头怪物在草丛中俯身，横在小满的身前。\n他浑浊的眼睛看不清眼前的事物，天地仿佛在眼前无尽地旋转。他浑身的血液都在轰鸣，他再听不见任何声音。\n直到那一声清脆的惊呼像一根针刺入他的耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"小满转身想跑，但她随即又横起笛子，更尖锐的笛声传入他的耳朵。\n花开了，快回家吧♪\n你听，你听，是我在呼唤你回来♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......花开了，该回家了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他往前迈了一步。\n一只白生生的小手牵住了他的手指。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，我们走吧......你不认识回家的路了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么不想回去？你怕吓到别人是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证，大家不会再怕你了，也不会再把你当怪人了......谁再敢说你的坏话，我挨个用笛子敲他们的头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起回去，好吗......"},{"type":"narration","text":"他臂膀上系着的红绸突然松开，被风吹着一卷，悠悠飞向天空。\n樵夫浑浊的眼滚出大滴大滴的泪水，但小满浑然未觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，快跑——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g13_pollutedfield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底还有多少......这些怪物真的杀不完吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能尽量把它们挡在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是让大家不要害怕......怎么可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁见过这种阵仗......"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前是广袤的田野，长相可怖的怪物仍在源源不断地从地里长出，难以计数。\n在二人身后，人们排起漫长的队伍，向中央城区缓缓行进。\n队伍中不断有哭声传来。精通源石技艺的土木天师勉强构筑起防线，挡在人群和怪物之间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"脚下的土地一阵震动，紧接着，人群中又传来几声哭泣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一块移动地块已经和核心城脱节了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"试验田土壤各种参数的控制，都依赖核心城的能源供给......现在切断能源，那片田也废了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怨恨的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*炎国粗口*，哪里来的畜生。我们多少年的心血，都被你们害的，全没了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"怨恨的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种了这么多年地，什么时候受过这种憋屈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*炎国粗口*，对啊！凭什么要我们跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些畜生要毁我们的地，啃我们的庄稼，我们就和它们干到底！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大伙一起上，和这些畜生拼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家——当心......"},{"type":"narration","text":"有人捡起遗落在田间的锄头，回过头冲向了未知的怪物。锄头狠狠落在怪物的头上，竟也打得怪物一个趔趄。\n职农不顾一切地捡起手边的物件向怪物们丢去，石头、农具。\n被随手掷出的一瓶对付害兽的农药砸在怪物身上，瓶子碎裂，怪物发出哀鸣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诡异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的鸣叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也......可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......打......打死了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有用！这个有用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了！这些东西都是那些田里的害兽变的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*炎国粗口*，什么妖魔鬼怪，说到底不还是一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都别害怕！大伙抄家伙，把这些糟蹋庄稼的畜生收拾了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"紧接着，越来越多的人拿起手头的工具加入了防线。有人铆足力气唱起了戏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g13_pollutedfield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，别在这停下！再走几步，我们马上就要到了......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诡异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（凄厉的尖啸）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！走开！走开！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔！你怎么......呜......你先把你的伤口按住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，没事的，我们就快到了！我之前还背过受伤的小驮兽回家，你看起来比他们重不了多少，相信我，我也能把你带回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都......滚开啊......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许过来......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不许......过——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小小身体跌落地面，响在樵夫的耳朵里，他强撑着身体，再次举起武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉重的喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗬呃——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的天师学徒？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......祖......祖师......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你下去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的神志已经到极限了，别再动手了，我可不想再亲手杀一个徒弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，还有一个那么机灵的女儿，总不能让她双亲都不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕没法再让她认你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（轻微的呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是苦了你们了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本想着回大荒城养会伤，还能碰上这么一档子事......臭绣花的，别让我逮着你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"灿金色的顽童环顾四周，伸手探向自己的腰带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的扇子呢......？"},{"type":"narration","text":"诡异的织物则像是察觉到了危险，在四周踟蹰着不敢靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不争气的徒子徒孙还问我为什么不怕这些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是想问，杀了它们这么多，这些东西为什么不怕我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诡异的织物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（恐惧的哀鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滔天的气流霎时间席卷而起，天师金色的身影腾起光与热，扭曲了一方空间，炽白色的火焰在原野上勾勒出一道天堑。\n她轻轻打了一个响指。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#000000>老阅人间久，曾降百万魔。</color>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"桑麻日已长，我土日已广......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敢教邪祟诡魔辟易，天地焕新光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啦......啦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"茧已经结好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该抽丝了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"},{"type":"narration","text":"一只羽兽飞过。\n这地方原本不该有羽兽，日月星辰，风霜雨雪，山川河流，这地方原本都不该有。\n但这只羽兽衔来一株稻穗，挥挥翅膀，停在一座小山的山峰上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这颗心脏跳动、跳动，有什么即将破土而出——\n一阵风吹过，禾苗摇摇晃晃。\n河流不断，水奔腾着。\n山川隆起，土石轰鸣着。\n树木扎根，荫翳摇晃着。\n羽兽似有所感，衔着稻穗再度飞起，掉下两粒稻种，落入无边的水田中。\n刷——拉——，刷——拉——\n一双眼睁开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"混沌的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"混沌的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你回来了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
